[[Category:Tmp_xyobj(neg)]]

Goshawk are birds found in [[Badlands]]. They can fly over cliffs, and normally fly around on 5d speed. If you kill them, you can pick them up like [[rabbit]]s. [[Dead Goshawk]] takes 1x2 slots in the inventory.

==Combat==

===Behaviour===

Rarely Aggressive, always flying around.

